<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Invicta details capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>Invicta details capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invicta Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that shareholders registered in the firm's books on June 27 would be eligible for a capitalisation share award.</p>
<p>In terms of the award shareholders will receive new shares in the ratio of 1.80 capitalstaion shares for every 100 held at the record date.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
